                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56a5ff4b-e80a-31fe-8262-27014fe46a3c",
                        "entry_id": "97f1eba7-bf58-3e68-91f8-c74a20856c8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ёмкость, предназначенная для хранения и транспортировки жидкостей, с ручкой (ручками) для переноски и герметически закрывающейся горловиной"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0329b48d-b561-4fa3-94dd-0b86522f9fd5",
                                "sense_id": "56a5ff4b-e80a-31fe-8262-27014fe46a3c",
                                "text": "Крупные камни я пускал под колесо, и каждый раз в багажнике лязгали и громыхали пустые канистры."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c00e16e-a396-4801-ad5f-9c0d455f15c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "97f1eba7-bf58-3e68-91f8-c74a20856c8d",
                        "source_sense_id": "56a5ff4b-e80a-31fe-8262-27014fe46a3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "jerrycan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jerrycan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6972db71-98c4-3c3a-9d9f-bee287e7d4c1",
                                        "entry_id": "231e9293-cb2e-3d4e-842a-d7e54ff3814c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A robust container for fuel or water, of a certain more or less rectangular shape, often made from pressed steel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d13eae70-f603-4a5d-8f4c-6af96f03774b",
                                                "sense_id": "6972db71-98c4-3c3a-9d9f-bee287e7d4c1",
                                                "text": "The police fell back, swatting and cursing. At the gateway, somebody grabbed a jerrycan of water from Jonamon's hut and flung its contents at the swarm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ea24a51-fb18-423f-bcf8-0d3e3c8e9282",
                                                "sense_id": "6972db71-98c4-3c3a-9d9f-bee287e7d4c1",
                                                "text": "Anyone with half a brain and a jerrycan of fertilizer's got an army."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
